# FF - REMIXED - PVE — what must NEVER reach the repository
#
# Rule: we version TEMPLATES (*.example.json), never the real files.
# A secret pushed once stays in git history even if deleted afterwards — you then have to
# rewrite history AND rotate the secret. Far better to never write it down.

# --- SECRETS ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dedicated server config: holds passwordAdmin and rcon.password.
config.json
server/config.json
# Website API key (Fleet/GTG): grants write access to the live map.
GTG.json
**/Fleet/GTG.json
server/profile/Fleet/GTG.json
# Discord webhooks, misc keys.
*.secret
*.secret.json
.env
.env.*

# --- GAME DATA -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Saves, databases and logs: server-specific, large, and containing player identifiers
# (Bohemia UIDs — personal data).
.save/
.db/
logs/
logs_*/
*.log
profile/profile/
server/profile/*.json
!server/profile/*.example.json

# --- BUILD ARTEFACTS -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated by the Workbench on every import; versioning them creates endless conflicts.
*.pak
*.rdb
resourceDatabase.rdb
*_manifest.json
ServerData.json
meta
thumbnail.png
preview*.jpg

# --- WORKBENCH -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local editor state, specific to each machine.
*.ebackup
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.tmp
unnamed.ent
unnamed_Layers/

# --- MISC ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
scratchpad/

# --- DEAD WEIGHT / PERSONAL DATA -------------------------------------------------------
# Loadout backups: contain real player Bohemia UIDs (personal data) and are snapshots of
# OUR server's state — useless to anyone else.
backup/
# Prefabs deliberately retired (see FFRX_SpecialistWeights.c): kept locally as a reference,
# but shipping them would suggest they are still wired in. They are not.
_REMOVED_*/
# Superseded working notes.
GAME_DESIGN_ARCHIVE.md
ETAT_SESSION_*.md
*.md.bak_*
